# JSON 请求体与 HTTP 动词示例，只访问 httpbin.org。

### 创建资源 (POST)
POST {{host}}/post
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "environment": "{{envName}}",
  "active": true,
  "tags": [
    "api",
    "httpbin"
  ]
}

### 替换资源 (PUT)
PUT {{host}}/put
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": 1001,
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "source": "{{meta.source}}"
}

### 局部更新 (PATCH)
PATCH {{host}}/patch
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "updated",
  "operator": "{{name}}"
}
